  "solution": "Power received: $P = 20\\ \\text{W/cm}^2 \\times 20\\ \\text{cm}^2 = 400$ W.\n\n$$E = Pt = 400 \\times 60 = 24000\\ \\text{J} = 24 \\times 10^3\\ \\text{J}$$",
